## 🔌 Using SkyBrain via MCP (Model Context Protocol)

SkyBrain provides standard MCP tools:
- `skybrain_expert_consensus(file_path, rounds=3)`: 2/3 consensus multi-lens code evaluation.
- `skybrain_query(prompt, image_path=None)`: Fast local SLM inference on Apple Silicon.
- `skybrain_translate(text, target_lang, source_lang)`: 12-language local interpreter.
- `skybrain_summarize_logs(log_text)`: Noise-filtered log extraction.

